          <p>Estimates are based on standard conversion formulas and typical tax rates as of May 2026. Actual compensation varies by employer, location, tax filing status, and individual circumstances. Self-employment tax is estimated at 15.3% of 92.35% of net earnings. Benefits values are illustrative averages.</p>
